        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jordan Roberts, George C. Wolfe, Shana Feste, Michelle Wildgen\n- Films: Big Hero 6, Ferdinand, You're Not You\n- Companies: Disney, Blue Sky Studios, 20th Century Fox Animation\n- Awards: Academy Awards, Annie Awards\n\nFacts:\n- Jordan Roberts was born as Bruce Robert Jordan on June 19, 1957, and he is an American screenwriter and film director.\n- Big Hero 6 is a 2014 animated Disney film, and Jordan Roberts co-wrote its screenplay.\n- Jordan Roberts was nominated for the Annie Award for Writing in a Feature Production for Big Hero 6.\n- You're Not You is a 2014 American drama film directed by George C. Wolfe and written by Jordan Roberts and Shana Feste.\n- You're Not You is based on a novel of the same name by Michelle Wildgen.\n- Ferdinand is a 2017 American 3D computer-animated comedy film produced by Blue Sky Studios and 20th Century Fox Animation.\n- Jordan Roberts is known for co-writing the screenplays for Big Hero 6 and Ferdinand.",
